        "page": 7,
        "quote": "GPT-4\nvalidation Direct prompt 19%\nAlphaCodium 44%\ntest Direct prompt 12%\nAlphaCodium 29%"
      },
      {
        "kind": "limitation",
        "claim": "The paper notes evaluation subtleties in comparisons to prior systems, qualifying those comparisons without invalidating the reported direct-prompt comparisons.",
        "page": 7,
        "quote": "There are subtleties when evaluating results."
